# The office SOURCE DOCUMENTS and the verbatim extractions of them are not committed. What IS
# committed is public/ — every column a lookup reads, with the offices' own sentences left out.
#
# TIPO publishes under an open government licence; CNIPA's site notice permits no commercial
# reproduction, KIPO publishes none, JPO's PDL1.0 has unconfirmed carve-outs. One rule for all four:
# data travels, quotation does not. See export-public.mjs for what that means column by column.
#
# An absent source is not an empty one: coverage.mjs refuses by name for anything unbuilt.
